          "type": "improvement",
          "priority": "medium",
          "timestamp": "2026-04-15T09:58:01Z",
          "note": "src/server/routes/workspaces.ts: The workspace-existence check at the top of both new handlers is copy-pasted from existing handlers (setup, health, regenerate-workspace-file). A small private helper `verifyWorkspaceExists(res, projectId, workspaceId): boolean` would reduce this duplication across 5+ handlers."
        }
      ]
    },
